msgid ":gh:`103089`: IDLE no longer hangs when opening a file with very long lines. Only the first 2,000 characters of a line are colorized."
msgstr ""

msgid ":gh:`70331`: IDLE no longer fails to start with ``python -m idlelib``, and its user process no longer fails to start, when the current directory contains user files with the same names as standard library modules that IDLE imports, such as ``random.py`` or ``tkinter.py``."
msgstr ""

msgid ":gh:`93016`: Fix parsing of command line arguments in the IDLE \"Run... Customized\" dialog on Windows: backslashes are no longer treated as escape characters. Fix also display of the previous arguments in the dialog."
msgstr ""

