msgstr ""

msgid ":gh:`105689`: Fix calltips, parenthesis matching and auto-indent in the IDLE Shell after output containing unbalanced quotes or parentheses."
msgstr ""

msgid ":gh:`60402`: In IDLE, Tab in a string that is not the start of a file name inserts a tab instead of opening the completion list."
msgstr ""

msgid ":gh:`68453`: Fix running IDLE with the -s option together with -c, -r or -: the command or script now runs after the startup file, without an error dialog and without restarting the shell."
msgstr ""

msgid ":gh:`69919`: IDLE now reports any exception raised by compiling the source, such as :exc:`MemoryError` for too deeply nested source, instead of hanging the Shell."
msgstr ""

