msgid ":gh:`71136`: Fix a hang of the IDLE Shell when code run under the debugger raises :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt`."
msgstr ""

msgid ":gh:`154511`: Consolidate IDLE's mouse wheel handling in ``idlelib.util``. ``wheel_event`` moves there from ``idlelib.tree`` and joins ``x11_buttons``, which tells whether Tk reports wheel rotations to a widget as ``<Button-4>``/``<Button-5>`` events, and ``bind_wheel``, which binds whichever events Tk sends."
