msgid ":gh:`113318`: Fix Argument Clinic for ``@getter`` and ``@setter`` in a preprocessor conditional block. It failed with an internal error. Argument Clinic now also rejects the accessors of the same attribute with different C basenames, and the same accessor defined twice, which silently generated invalid or duplicated entries of :c:type:`PyGetSetDef`."
