msgid ":issue:`45440`: Building Python now requires a C99 ``<math.h>`` header file providing the following functions: ``copysign()``, ``hypot()``, ``isfinite()``, ``isinf()``, ``isnan()``, ``round()``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
