msgid ":issue:`43851`: Build SQLite ``SQLITE_OMIT_AUTOINIT`` on Windows. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`44828`: Avoid tkinter file dialog failure on macOS 12 Monterey when using the Tk 8.6.11 provided by python.org macOS installers. Patch by Marc Culler of the Tk project."
