msgid ":issue:`44698`: Restore behaviour of complex exponentiation with integer-valued exponent of type :class:`float` or :class:`complex`."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`44895`: A debug variable :envvar:`PYTHONDUMPREFSFILE` is added for creating a dump file which is generated by :option:`--with-trace-refs`. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""

