msgid "Python 3.10.0 alpha 6"
msgstr ""

msgid "*Release date: 2021-03-01*"
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`42967`: Fix web cache poisoning vulnerability by defaulting the query args separator to ``&``, and allowing the user to choose a custom separator."
