msgid ":issue:`42856`: Add ``--with-wheel-pkg-dir=PATH`` option to the ``./configure`` script. If specified, the :mod:`ensurepip` module looks for ``setuptools`` and ``pip`` wheel packages in this directory: if both are present, these wheel packages are used instead of ensurepip bundled wheel packages."
