msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`38891`: Fix linear runtime behaviour of the ``__getitem__`` and ``__setitem__`` methods in :class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.ShareableList`. This avoids quadratic performance when iterating a ``ShareableList``. Patch by Thomas Krennwallner."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`39682`: Remove undocumented support for *closing* a ``pathlib.Path`` object via its context manager. The context manager magic methods remain, but they are now a no-op, making ``Path`` objects immutable."
