msgid ":issue:`38883`: :meth:`~pathlib.Path.home` and :meth:`~pathlib.Path.expanduser` on Windows now prefer :envvar:`USERPROFILE` and no longer use :envvar:`HOME`, which is not normally set for regular user accounts. This makes them again behave like :func:`os.path.expanduser`, which was changed to ignore :envvar:`HOME` in 3.8, see :issue:`36264`."
