msgid ":issue:`32941`: Allow :class:`mmap.mmap` objects to access the madvise() system call (through :meth:`mmap.mmap.madvise`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`22102`: Added support for ZIP files with disks set to 0. Such files are commonly created by builtin tools on Windows when use ZIP64 extension. Patch by Francisco Facioni."
