msgid ":issue:`36004`: Added new alternate constructors :meth:`datetime.date.fromisocalendar` and :meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisocalendar`, which construct date objects from ISO year, week number and weekday; these are the inverse of each class's ``isocalendar`` method. Patch by Paul Ganssle."
