msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`35918`: Removed broken ``has_key`` method from multiprocessing.managers.SyncManager.dict. Contributed by Rémi Lapeyre."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`18283`: Add support for bytes to :func:`shutil.which`."
