msgid ":issue:`33929`: multiprocessing: Fix a race condition in Popen of multiprocessing.popen_spawn_win32. The child process now duplicates the read end of pipe instead of \"stealing\" it. Previously, the read end of pipe was \"stolen\" by the child process, but it leaked a handle if the child process had been terminated before it could steal the handle from the parent process."
