msgid ":issue:`26544`: Fixed implementation of :func:`platform.libc_ver`. It almost always returned version '2.9' for glibc."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`33843`: Remove deprecated ``cgi.escape``, ``cgi.parse_qs`` and ``cgi.parse_qsl``."
