msgid ":issue:`33842`: Remove ``tarfile.filemode`` which is deprecated since Python 3.3."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`30167`: Prevent site.main() exception if PYTHONSTARTUP is set. Patch by Steve Weber."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`33805`: Improve error message of dataclasses.replace() when an InitVar is not specified"
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`33687`: Fix the call to ``os.chmod()`` for ``uu.decode()`` if a mode is given or decoded. Patch by Timo Furrer."
