msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`25663`: In the Readline completer, avoid listing duplicate global names, and search the global namespace before searching builtins."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`25688`: Fixed file leak in ElementTree.iterparse() raising an error."
msgstr ""

