msgid ":issue:`25593`: Change semantics of EventLoop.stop() in asyncio."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`6973`: When we know a subprocess.Popen process has died, do not allow the send_signal(), terminate(), or kill() methods to do anything as they could potentially signal a different process."
msgstr ""

