msgid ":issue:`21781`: ssl.RAND_add() now supports strings longer than 2 GB."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`21679`: Prevent extraneous fstat() calls during open().  Patch by Bohuslav Kabrda."
msgstr ""

msgid ":issue:`21863`: cProfile now displays the module name of C extension functions, in addition to their own name."
msgstr ""

